id: cat-burglar
name: Cat Burglar
talentCategory: racial
race: neko-majin
prerequisites: Neko Majin Race, 2+ Skill Ranks in Thievery
description: >
  With feline grace and incredible reflexes, your nimble-fingered antics go more easily unnoticed.
text: >
  Cat Burglar: With feline grace and incredible reflexes, your nimble-fingered antics go more easily unnoticed.
  –Prerequisites: Neko Majin Race, 2+ Skill Ranks in Thievery
  (1)-[Passive]: Increase the Skill Bonus of your Thievery by 1.
  (2)-[Passive]: Your Majin-Dama cannot be stolen unless you are Defeated.
  (3)-[Triggered, 1/Round]: If you have to use another Skill for a Clash initiated by an Opponent, you may use your Thievery Skill instead.
  (4)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you win the Clash for the Snatch Special Maneuver against an Opponent, you may select a Signature Technique they know. It becomes a Copied Technique as if obtained through the 1st effect of Quick Learner.

---

[passive]
# (1)
skill.thievery += 1;
# (2) Not Snatched while you are Sleeping - Defeated only (majin-dama.mjs snatchableDama).
allow catBurglar.dama;
# (3) A Skill Clash an Opponent opened: Thievery among what you may answer it with, once a Round (chat.mjs).
allow catBurglar.thievery;

# (4) The Snatch's Clash won (snatch-won): which of their Signature Techniques, asked - Copied, as Quick Learner (1)'s, once an Encounter
# (chat.mjs catBurglarCopy). Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/snatch-won, 1/encounter, effect 4]
catBurglarCopy();
